description:
he UK's Highest Customer Rated Princess Party Entertainment;

Magical, Imaginative and Action-Packed Children’s Parties. We are Snow Princess Parties; professional children’s party entertainers with a difference. 

We believe that Princesses shouldn’t just be gorgeous – they should be fun too! So we don our sparkly trainers and lead your children in magical, action-packed games, with exciting prizes and vibrant costumes! Our parties are designed to provide your children with memories to last a lifetime, by allowing them to spend a day with their favourite character – from Princesses, Fairies and Mermaids, to Superheroes, Pirates and Trollz!

